# ── Operating system clutter ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# These get created automatically when you open a folder in Explorer or Finder.
# They are not part of the mod and would only add noise to the release archive.
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes

# ── Editor and tooling scratch ─────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~

# ── Working files that should never ship ───────────────────────────────────
_to_delete/
*.bak
*.orig
*.rej
*.tmp

# NOTE: nothing inside the mod folder itself is ignored. .txt, .yml, .gui,
# .dds, .mesh, .anim and .mod files are all mod content and must be committed.

# Release artifacts built locally — attached to GitHub Releases, never committed.
*.zip
